(1)     2B9 : 2940                       tbit    R1, 0, z        skip if dividend>=0
(1)     2BA : CF6C                       b       divu16_neg
(1)     2BB : 51FA                       c       R1, R2, lm      skip if dividend<divisor
(1)     2BC : CF03                       b       divu16_shift
(1)     2BD : 7908                       mv      R1, R0          quotient=0
(1)     2BE : 2003                       ret
(1)     2BF :                    *** Shift divisor up until it exceeds dividend, then enter the step
(1)     2BF :                    *** that shifts it back down; dividend<X'8000' bounds this to 14.
